 iwd,
Description: terminal interface for managing wifi through iwd
 impala scans, connects to and manages wireless networks from a
 terminal interface, driving iwd over D-Bus. It supports both station
 and access-point modes.
 .
 iwd must be the active wireless backend: NetworkManager or
 wpa_supplicant managing the same interface will conflict with it.
